r a ton of anger in  my life because I'm too busy making  positive changes that's where we want to  get you we want to shift your attention  and focus in the morning we want to  start making you more solution based and  get your community of people around who  are ambitious and driven to change and  to make positive change happen when we  do that the anger starts going away and  if you can't get over the anger yourself  then don't be shy about asking for help  you know a lot of people they don't have  anybody to talk to so I'm like get a  therapist man get in a group man talk  with some people go to a seminar getting  a new sort of environment you want to  get rid of the anger go volunteer get  around other people who are making  positive impacts that community that  shift changes your life you don't have  to be angry anymore and the last part  about that is Letting Go  you got to let go of those things that  upset you three years ago five years ago  ten years ago if you're an adult and  you're still  still angry and pissed pissed things  that happen to you and why  and I say that with all sincerity and  all respect if you're having mental  thoughts that are coming from a place  that are literally based 5 10 20 years  ago that you just didn't deal with yet  you need help dealing with it and you  need to get yourself a meditation  practice or a therapist or into some  kind of way that you're on a consistent  basis letting things go here's what I do  every Sunday I go okay what was I pissed  about this last week what really  bothered me okay I gotta let that go  because you can't keep charging into the  next week angry from last week you got  to let it go you got to find a clean  slate for yourself so that your your  soul can expand and can be positive and  can be ambitious and motivated and  serving the next week because listen  anger after anger after anger hatred  after hatred after hatred criticism  after criticism after criticism  rejection after rejection after 